{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation complete, pushed as Gerrit change 1265 (commit 025cf1c3bb, stacked on 1262/1257).\n\nTest-only change (authored directly per plan; no implementer subagent needed):\n- tests/interfaces/store/sync_contention_harness.py — hoisted _git/_rebar_cli(+timeout)/_clear_sync_throttle/build_repo_with_origin_tickets from test_show_no_stall.py\n- tests/interfaces/store/conftest.py — shared repo_with_origin_tickets fixture (REBAR_SYNC_PUSH=off during build, REBAR_ROOT pinned)\n- tests/interfaces/store/test_show_no_stall.py — refactored to import the harness; both ed2b tests byte-for-byte identical in behavior (2 passed post-refactor)\n- tests/interfaces/store/test_reads_under_sync_contention.py — the generalized property, table-driven over show/list/search/ready: (A) write-burst storm — 3 rounds of edit bursts with background pushes, per-surface throttle clear, exit0 => stdout parses as documented JSON shape (dict for show, list for list/search/ready; valid-empty [] passes, truncated-empty fails); (B) deterministic held-write-lock — thread holds lock.acquire(timeout=30), each surface must complete within 10s.\n\nProbed before writing: search with zero matches emits [] exit 0 (not empty text), ready --output json emits JSON array — so the shape assertions hold vacuously-safely on empty stores.\n\nRED demonstrated: reverting _RECONVERGE_LOCK_TIMEOUT 2 -> 15 (the writer default that caused ed2b) fails test B (show stalls >10s). Restored, all green: 4 passed in module+refactored pair; full tier 323 passed (1 pre-existing env-specific failure in test_tracker_config_e2e — git for-each-ref exit 128 on temp bare remote, fails identically on clean stash tree, unrelated)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785726589704509001,"uuid":"51f1b07a-691a-4b24-8751-aced9a2b8b88"}